{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15765","headline":"送李嘉佑正字括图书兼往扬州觐省 · 司空曙","name":"送李嘉佑正字括图书兼往扬州觐省","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不事兰台贵，全多韦带风。\n儒官比刘向，使者得陈农。\n晚烧平芜外，朝阳叠浪东。\n归来喜调膳，寒笋出林中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15765.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15765","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}